{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>As YHWH commanded Moses</b> — written concerning every matter, corresponding to what Moses said: <b>erase me now</b> — much mention of it. And they are 18 times <b>as YHWH commanded Moses</b> and <b>according to all that YHWH commanded Moses</b>, and corresponding to them they instituted 18 blessings. And one <b>as YHWH commanded, so they did</b>, and corresponding to it they instituted the blessing of the heretics, and it has 113 words. And likewise at the conclusions of the blessings, such as <b>Blessed are You, YHWH, Shield of Abraham</b>; <b>Blessed are You, YHWH, who gives life to the dead</b> — and in them 113 words. And 113 times <b>lev</b> (heart) in the Chumash, which require intention of the heart."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:22.277528721Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}